        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani yayu kakhu kakhate waan jed'e: Wonti anini herege inuma taati, wonti anini malad'e inhanqatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini worra Ashuru lafa tiyya keesaa balleese, gaareeni tiyya gubbati ira ejaanjad'a. Anini worra kiyya qaampara worra Ashuru iraa baase ulfinna worri baatu iraa fuud'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini mala kiyya, ka anini lafa ch'ufati malad'e, kunileeni harka kiyya, ka anini d'eerefad'e gosa ch'ufaani gaargalchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani ya waan kana herege; eenuti dandae isa d'owa? Inni harka ufi d'eerefate nama balleesu fed'a; eenuti dandae harka isaa keesa deebisa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
