        {
          "text": "Isani worri Filisti, waan uleeni isani d'oofte ch'abt'eefi ingammadina. Hojja bofi toko duu, ka hagasi ira hammaati fulla suni d'alata. Wonti bofi sunini d'alu bofa barisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nama ch'ufa ira hiyyeesa d'eeda argate, ka woma inqamne nagayaani taa. Ammo AABBO Waaqi beela hamtu isani worra Filistiti erge, nama tokole bahu d'owa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        }
